====
Libraries add the controls, registers, and processes to the home. Answer the questions. A "yes" shows the buttons of the libraries that the home needs, below the questions. Click the buttons to add the libraries. A "no" adds nothing, and it does not delete anything from the home. The answers about the CRA and NIS2 give the questions about the work a recommended answer. Click an answer to change it.

*What must you comply with?*

[cols="5,2,6"]
|===
| Question | Answer | Effect

| Must the products in the scope of this home meet the EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA)?
| {{#field}}"field": "ismsa/fieldTypes/homeCra", "display": "inline", "showLabel": false{{/field}}
| {{#if this.craLibraries}}Offers {{#each this.craLibraries}}{{this.title}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}: a checklist of the CRA requirements of the organisation. {{/if}}Recommends the central security work. Product duties are in the secure development and EU CRA modules.

| Does NIS2 apply to the organisation, or do you want to follow NIS2 for another reason, for example because customers require it?
